<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-final matches</p>
<p>in the English Football Association (F.A.) Cup on Sunday:</p>
<p> Chesterfield	   1  Wrexham	  0</p>
<p> Portsmouth	     v  Chelsea	  kickoff 1330 GMT</p>
<p> Sheffield Wednesday  v  Wimbledon	kickoff 1610 GMT</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Derby		    0  Middlesbrough  2</p>
</text>
